From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: herdr-universal-preview <hup@localhost>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 21:11:44 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] native views for mods: nativeView element and
 native-view/0 functions

The herdr module gains a nativeView(id, props) component plus
nativeViewCapabilities, nativeViewCall and nextNativeViewEvent. The views
(WKWebView, PDFView, AVPlayerView, QLPreviewView) live in the
herdr-native-view crate of herdr-universal-preview; src/native_view.rs
records where each element was painted (clipped to its content mask) and
a canvas painted last in the window moves the views there, hides them
while their copy is off screen or a dialog/popup/window/pane drag may be
above, and drops views whose copy is gone.

Also: native.debug / native.call commands for the test harness; a
Herdr Preview Dev build (HUP_DEV_BUILD) refuses to start without
HERDR_APP_HOME; regenerated THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES for the new crates.

